 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Congratulations! Start with basics like food and a quiet space. Is there a room you can rent for the weekend, or would everyone rather stay at someone's home? Nice. That gives you the backyard for breaks and some space too. Do you want host dinner every evening, or leave food going during the day? Roughly the same foods for everyone is fair. If someone has food allergy, ask the rest at the door. Nice. And someone else make a simple sauce with pasta and vegetables? Lots of bread and cheese go a long way too. Keep it simple. One room with beds, and a shared kitchen and bathroom. Turn off phones at night.",
